{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S07、S13、S14压缩了人物动机和情绪转折，尤其从期待到害怕失去、再到决定不隐藏心意的心理递进，不如Y交代得完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点词有明显视觉层级，话与感受交替呈现，部分感受又随音乐到时出现，听众比较容易在扫屏时抓住当前重点，并把细微的音乐变化对应到具体感受。它在音乐质感、身体感受和情绪细节上的表达也更丰富具体。Y的优势是人物叙述更完整，动机、担忧和心理变化之间的因果关系交代得更清楚，前后故事更容易连成一条线；但右侧感受词同时呈现，容易变成一组需要自行归纳的提示。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "95375171-5238-4dcb-8bea-4aafaa46450c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T073623032184Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:37:37.900294+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e486389aeb1b96193ec9408010d221b95d81b38013c23f200d60af3c981eae2b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\